--- Skater_unique | star power | TID_SKATER_SP_1_DESC
raw  While near walls, Ollie kicks off his hoverboard and gains <!card.statuseffect.baseSpeedIncreasePercent>% extra movement speed.
now  While near walls, Ollie kicks off his hoverboard and gains 20% extra movement speed.
  card.statuseffect.baseSpeedIncreasePercent  20  -> 20

--- Skater_unique_2 | star power | TID_SKATER_SP_2_DESC
raw  After dashing forward with his Super, Ollie gains a <!card.value1> decaying shield over <!card.value2.ticksasseconds> seconds.
now  After dashing forward with his Super, Ollie gains a 3000 decaying shield over 4 seconds.
  card.value1  3000  -> 3000
  card.value2.ticksasseconds  4  -> 4

--- Skater_ulti | super | TID_SKATER_ULTI_DESC
raw  Ollie dashes forward with a gnarly hoverboard trick and starts charging a music blast, dealing <VALUE1> damage and hypnotizing all enemies around him for <VALUE2> seconds. While charging his music blast, Ollie will use up to <VALUE3>% of his max ammo. Enemies will move towards Ollie and cannot be controlled while being hypnotized.
now  Ollie dashes forward with a gnarly hoverboard trick and starts charging a music blast, dealing <VALUE1> damage and hypnotizing all enemies around him for <VALUE2> seconds. While charging his music blast, Ollie will use up to <VALUE3>% of his max ammo. Enemies will move towards Ollie and cannot be controlled while being hypnotized.
  VALUE1  -  -> 1600
  VALUE2  -  -> 2.5
  VALUE3  -  -> 50
